This system is an overlay on unmodified DragonFly. The root filesystem of
this release image is UFS: the release tooling of DragonFly creates the
image root with newfs. There is no ZFS on DragonFly.

  * Built with the stock DragonFly tooling: no patched /usr/src.
  * The extra software comes from DPorts; the base system is the real thing.
  * The desktop is X11 with Xfce and the LightDM greeter; there is no
    Wayland anywhere.
